# API Keys Configuration Template
# 
# Copy this file to 'api-keys.conf' and add your actual API keys
# 
# IMPORTANT: 
#   - The api-keys.conf file will be ignored by git for security
#   - Never commit actual API keys to version control
#   - Get your Agroportal API key from: https://agroportal.lirmm.fr/account
#
# Usage:
#   1. Copy this file: cp api-keys.conf.template api-keys.conf
#   2. Edit api-keys.conf with your actual API keys
#   3. Run the installation script normally
#

# Agroportal API Key (required for ontology integration)
AGROPORTAL_API_KEY="your-agroportal-api-key-here"

# Future API keys can be added below:
# OTHER_SERVICE_API_KEY="your-other-key-here"